<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Fauji Fertilizer net 27 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Fauji Fertilizer net 27 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31 1996 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		     11,894 vs 8,510</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   3,946 vs 2,735</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 2,453 vs 1,929</p>
<p>    Interim dividend I    20 pct vs 12.5 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Interim dividend II   20 pct vs 20 pct</p>
<p>    Final dividend	  25 pct vs 17.5 pct</p>
<p>    Interim div for 97    20 pct vs 65 pct total for 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Fauji Fertilizer Co Ltd. Book closure June 9-23.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
